=== Pell and affine companion recurrences ===
P_n and A_n checked through n=201; A_(n+2)=2A_(n+1)+A_n-1.

=== Monotone candidate phases ===
U_n=A_n/(P_n+1) decreases, with the sole adjacent tie U_2=U_3=1/3.

=== All-length safe witness and global interval collapse ===
For every N<=200 the phase delta_N is safe and the proof interval collapses to t=delta_N.
The same displayed inequalities are symbolic in N; the computation is a hostile replay, not induction by sampling.

